Add heartbeat timer in constructor, startNight, update. Also maybe update `usage` numbers? Usage is a relative display, not exact. Fine. But the usage meter increments per door, light, cam. Keep.

Add `_heartT = 0` in constructor and startNight. Then in update after `_updatePower` and before AI maybe:

```js
if (!this.blackout && this.power < 20) {
  this._heartT -= dt;
  if (this._heartT <= 0) {
    this._heartT = this.power < 10 ? .9 : 1.35;
    this.audio.heartbeat(this.power < 10 ? 1.35 : .85);
  }
} else {
  this._heartT = .5;
}
```

But if blackout happens, `_updatePower` calls `_beginBlackout` and returns; heartbeat should stop. The check after handles blackout. Good.

Add whisper in `_advance` when a moves: random 12%:
```js
if (Math.random() < .12) this.audio.whisper(a.side === 'left' ? -.6 : .6);
```
Also in `_retreat`. Maybe just advance.

Add audio methods.

